ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi200: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 3 edges on PLANE; PLANE: normal +Z, origin (0,0,0); main_e0: A(0,0,0)->H(1,0,0) — single incoming edge to hub vertex H; branch_e1: H(1,0,0)->B(2,1,0) — first outgoing branch from H; branch_e2: H(1,0,0)->C(2,-1,0) — second outgoing branch from H; vertex H has in-degree=1, out-degree=2 — branching topology; branching degree-3 vertex IS defect — not a valid closed wire; CheckOrder IS mechanism — sees 3 edges but misses branching; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
